        "Content": "• Immaculate four-bedroom A rated residence extending to 140 sq.m/ 1506sq.ft\n• Accommodation comprises of hallway, guest w.c., kitchen/dining area, utility, living room, four bedrooms, en-suite and family bathroom\n• Finished to an exceptional standard with herringbone flooring, electric blinds, radiator case covers, high quality appliances (2024) are a few of the many attributes that make this an exceptional home\n• Approached by a cobble-lock driveway providing ample parking for two cars, complete with an electric vehicle charging point, and ideally positioned overlooking a generous green area, making it particularly appealing to young families.\n• Highly convenient, family-friendly location on the edge of Clane village, within easy walking distance of a range of excellent amenities, including well-regarded schools, supermarkets, cafés, boutiques, restaurants, sports clubs, and leisure facilities\n• Coach Road Meadows benefits from excellent connectivity, with easy access to the M4 and M7 motorways, providing convenient routes to Dublin and surrounding counties\n• Clane is also well served by regular bus services 120 A ,120 B ,120X, one going directly to UCD Campus, while nearby towns such as Maynooth and Sallins offer rail links to the capital, making the area ideal for commuters.\n\nGuide Price\n575,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nAttractive cobblelock driveway, side gate.\n\nEntrance Hallway 1.00m x 3.10m\nHerringbone engineered wood floor, alarm panel.\n\nGuest W.C. 1.58m x 1.58m\nMarble effect tiled floor, w.c., w.h.b., splashback tiles, additional storage cabinet. \n\nLiving Room 4.70m x 5.51m\nHerringbone engineered wood floor, feature bay window, electric blinds. \n \nKitchen /Dining 5.50m x 5.55m \nHerringbone engineered wood floor, fully fitted kitchen with work top and upstands, double oven and microwave, electric hob, stainless steel splashback, extractor, integrated American style fridge freezer, island with additional cabinets, sink and integrated dishwasher, down lights, feature bay window, electric blinds. \nUtility Room 2.20m x 1.44m\nUnderstairs storage and additional shelving. \n\nLanding 5.85m x 9.98m\nFully carpeted including stairs, Hotpress, storage closet, attic access with Stira ladder. \n\nBedroom 1 2.58m x 4.47m\nSemi-solid floor, fitted wardrobes, decorative wall paper, blinds.\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.00m x 4.88m\nSemi-solid floor, fitted wardrobes, additional sockets, electric blinds.\n\nEnsuite 2.00m x 1.48m\nMarble effect tiled floor, tiled splashback areas, shower enclosure with power shower, w.c., w.h.b., towel radiator vanity storage cabinet.\n\nBathroom 2.20m x 1.88\nTiled floor, tiled splashback areas, deep filled bath, w.c., w.h.b., fitted mirror, towel radiator.\n\nBedroom 3 4.00m x 3.22m\nSemi-solid floor, fitted wardrobes, overlooking green area. \n\nBedroom 4 3.59m x 2.17m\nSemi-solid floor, fitted wardrobes.\n\nGarden \nGranite patio area, lawn area, surrounded by block-built wall and timber fence and post, air to water unit. Side pedestrian access.\n\nAdditional Information:\nBuilt in 2024\nFull masonry construction\nHigh thermal performance and levels of insulation\nHigh performance windows and external doors\nAir to Water heating with thermostatically controlled radiators\nDemand Control Ventilation\nCAT 6 cable wiring\nFloored attic \n\nItems Included in sale:\nFixtures and fittings, ovens and microwave, dishwasher, washing machine and tumble dryer, LED bathroom mirrors, all light fittings, alarm system, car charging port\n\nServices:\nMains Water\nAir to Water\n\nBER A2\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W91 XN5H\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright\n045 832020\n"
